      {
        "_uid": "c1047a68-3d4d-effd-ef7a-ef7e2902fcff",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "This is what our participants had to say about the event:",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "\"",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "For me, the beach cleaning and wildlife adventure provided a memorable, educational, and impactful experience that left a lasting impression, emphasizing the importance of responsible environmental stewardship.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "\" - AKU staff",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "\"",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Fostering teamwork during the beach cleaning segment was a brilliant initiative, promoting a sense of community and purpose among participants. It showcased the power of collective effort in making a difference.\"",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " - AKU staff",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "\"",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "I learnt a lot about the mangrove ecosystem. The most exciting part for me was the trek through the mangroves which enhanced active and experiential learning.",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "\" - AKU student",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                },
                {
                  "text": "\"",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Excellent trip and a great learning experience. The whole event was very well planned and executed. Very proud of the organisers!",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "\" - AKU faculty",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
